msgid "To use an external email provider, you should configure an MX record. To do so, open the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_, click the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) button next to the database name and select :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`. Click :guilabel:`DNS`, then :guilabel:`Add DNS record` and select :guilabel:`MX`. The values you should enter for the :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Content`, and :guilabel:`Priority` fields depend on the external email provider."
