msgstr "Ha először állítja be a Google Analytics-et, kattintson a :guilabel:`Start measuring` gombra, és menjen végig a fiók létrehozási lépésen."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:106
msgid "If you already have a Google Analytics account, sign in and click the :icon:`fa-cog` icon in the bottom-left corner of the page to access the **Admin** page. Then, click :guilabel:`+ Create` and select :guilabel:`Property` from the drop-down menu."
